          "description": "At the bottom forward frequency, dBmV per 6 MHz. `None` (version 2): the port is held at one level, at the top,\nas taps are nominally set [SCTE 183 §16.4] and as the one worked run states its devices (design-practice.md §1).\nThe bottom of the band is then bounded by the modem's window and its spread limit, which the sim checks.",
